Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是翘掉扫除的味道
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,*布加拉提？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:39.67,Viola,,0,0,0,,才 才没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.85,0:23:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,反而是协助了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,下集 离雪融化还早
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.27,0:23:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哦呀 粉笔灰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,判决 无罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:49.60,Viola,,0,0,0,,-哈...
